<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key><string>Choose a photo for the silly face mirror. Your photo stays on this device.</string>
<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key><string>Take a photo for the silly face mirror. Your photo stays on this device.</string>
<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key><string>Shake your device to swirl snow inside your JollyBOX snow globe.</string>
<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key><false/>
</dict></plist>
